sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as UpdateService
    participant R as Release source
    participant A as App and store
    participant H as Installer helper
    participant N as New build
    S->>R: Due check for selected channel and target
    R-->>S: Metadata and signed release manifest
    S->>S: Verify trust, version, target and staged bytes
    S-->>U: Version, compatibility and migration plan
    U->>S: Approve exact manifest and installation
    S->>A: Stop admission and bounded checkpoint/shutdown
    A-->>H: Confirm process exit and released data locks
    H->>H: Verify receipt and journal replacement
    H->>N: Apply approved asset and launch once
    N->>A: Open compatible data and validate matching Help
    alt Startup health succeeds
        N-->>H: Health handshake
        H->>H: Commit installed authority
    else Startup fails before incompatible data writes
        H->>H: Restore only compatible previous binary
        Note over H,A: Preserve data and recovery journal
    else Incompatible data transition already happened
        H-->>U: Explicit recovery with retained current data
        Note over U,A: No automatic data restore or downgrade
    end
    Note over A,N: Feature and issue work still require explicit Continue
